msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

msgid ""
"Molpro automatically stores various results and data in system variables "
"(see section `variables set by the program <variables.html#variables-set-by-"
"the-program>`__), which can be used for further processing. A new feature of"
" Molpro2002 is that most system variables are write protected and cannot be "
"overwritten by the user. The input is automatically checked before the job "
"starts, and should a system variable be set in the input the job will stop "
"immediately with an error message. Only in some exceptions (see section "
"`system variables <variables.html#system-variables>`__), system variables "
"can be modified using the ``SET`` command (but not with the simple "
"``NAME``\\ =\\ *value* syntax). Note that due to the changed usage and "
"syntax of the ``SET`` command, compatibility with Molpro92 input syntax is "
"no longer maintained."
msgstr ""
"Molpro会自动将各种结果和数据存储在系统变量中（参见\\ `variables set by the program "
"<variables.html#variables-set-by-the-program>`__\\ "
"一节），这些变量可用于进一步处理。Molpro2002的一个新特性是，大多数系统变量是写保护的，用户无法覆盖。输入在作业开始前会自动检查，如果输入中设置了系统变量，作业将立即停止并显示错误消息。只有在某些例外情况下（参见\\"
" `system variables <variables.html#system-variables>`__\\ 一节），系统变量可以使用\\ "
"``SET``\\ 命令修改（但不能使用简单的\\ ``NAME``\\ =\\ *value*\\ 语法）。请注意，由于\\ ``SET``\\ "
"命令的用法和语法发生了变化，不再保持与Molpro92输入语法的兼容性。"

msgid "Setting variables"
msgstr "设置变量"

msgid "A variable can be defined using"
msgstr "可以使用以下方式定义变量"

msgid ""
"A variable definition is recognized by the equals sign in the *first* field "
"of the input card. For example,"
msgstr "变量定义通过输入卡\\ *第一个*\\ 字段中的等号来识别。例如，"

msgid "``THRESH,ENERGY=1.d-8,GRADIENT=1.d-5``"
msgstr "``THRESH,ENERGY=1.d-8,GRADIENT=1.d-5``"

msgid ""
"does *not* define variables; here ``ENERGY`` and ``GRADIENT`` are options "
"for the ``THRESH`` directive."
msgstr "并\\ *不*\\ 定义变量；这里的 ``ENERGY`` 和 ``GRADIENT`` 是 ``THRESH`` 指令的选项。"

msgid "Variables can have different types:"
msgstr "变量可以有不同的类型："

msgid ""
"**Logicals:** The value can be ``.TRUE.`` or ``.FALSE.`` (``.T.`` and .F. "
"also work), or a logical expression. Internally, ``.TRUE.`` is stored as 1 "
"and ``.FALSE.`` as zero."
msgstr ""
"**逻辑值：** 值可以是 ``.TRUE.`` 或 ``.FALSE.``\\ （\\ ``.T.`` 和 .F. "
"也有效），或一个逻辑表达式。在内部，\\ ``.TRUE.`` 存储为 1，\\ ``.FALSE.`` 存储为零。"

msgid ""
"**Strings:** The value can either be a string enclosed in quotes or a string"
" variable. See section `string variables <variables.html#string-"
"variables>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"**字符串：** 值可以是用引号括起来的字符串或一个字符串变量。更多细节请参阅 `string variables "
"<variables.html#string-variables>`__ 一节。"

msgid "Indexed variables"
msgstr "索引变量"

msgid ""
"Variables can be indexed, but only one-dimensional indexing is available. "
"Indexed variables can be defined either individually, e.g."
msgstr "变量可以被索引，但仅支持一维索引。索引变量可以单独定义，例如，"

msgid "or as a vector of values enclosed by square brackets:"
msgstr "或作为用方括号括起来的值向量："

msgid "``R=[1.0,1.1,1.2] ANG``"
msgstr "``R=[1.0,1.1,1.2] ANG``"

msgid "Subranges can also be defined, e.g."
msgstr "也可以定义子范围，例如，"

msgid "leads to the same result as the above two forms."
msgstr "会得到与上述两种形式相同的结果。"

msgid ""
"The type of each element depends on the type of the assigned value, and it "
"is possible to mix types in one variable. Example:"
msgstr "每个元素的类型取决于所赋值类型，并且可以在一个变量中混合类型。示例："

msgid "yields:"
msgstr "得到："

msgid ""
"In this example the variables ``PROGRAM``, ``ENERGY``, and ``STATUS`` are "
"system variables, which are set by the program (see section `system "
"variables <variables.html#system-variables>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在此示例中，变量 ``PROGRAM``\\ 、\\ ``ENERGY`` 和 ``STATUS`` 是系统变量，由程序设置（参见 `system "
"variables <variables.html#system-variables>`__ 章节）。"

msgid "String variables"
msgstr "字符串变量"

msgid ""
"As explained already in section `setting variables <variables.html#setting-"
"variables>`__, string variables can be set as other variables in the form"
msgstr ""
"如 `setting variables <variables.html#setting-variables>`__ "
"章节中已解释的，字符串变量可以像其他变量一样以以下形式设置"

msgid ""
"Strings must be enclosed by quotes. Otherwise the string is assumed to be a "
"variable, and if this is undefined it is assumed to be zero."
msgstr "字符串必须用引号括起来。否则该字符串将被视为变量，如果该变量未定义，则假定为零。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, if the name of the variable is preceded by a dollar ($), all "
"values are assumed to be a string. This can be a string variable, a quoted "
"string, or an unquoted string. Note that unquoted strings are converted to "
"upper case. Also note that quotes are compulsory if the string contains "
"blanks."
msgstr ""
"或者，如果变量名前带有美元符号（$），则所有值都被假定为字符串。这可以是字符串变量、带引号的字符串或不带引号的字符串。请注意，不带引号的字符串会被转换为大写。另请注意，如果字符串包含空格，则引号是必需的。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "``$str=[a,b+4,’This is an example for strings’]``"
msgstr "``$str=[a,b+4,’This is an example for strings’]``"

msgid "yields"
msgstr "得到"

msgid ""
"As a general rule, string variables are replaced by their value only if they"
" are preceded by a dollar ($) (exceptions: in variable definitions, on "
"``SHOW`` cards, and in logical expressions on ``IF`` cards, the dollar is "
"optional). This is a precaution to avoid commands which have the same name "
"as a variable being interpreted as variables. Variables may also appear on "
"``TEXT`` or ``TITLE`` cards or in strings, but must be preceded by $ in "
"these cases. Example:"
msgstr ""
"作为一般规则，字符串变量仅在其前面带有美元符号（$）时才会被其值替换（例外情况：在变量定义中、在 ``SHOW`` 卡片上以及在 ``IF`` "
"卡片的逻辑表达式中，美元符号是可选的）。这是一种预防措施，以避免与变量同名的命令被解释为变量。变量也可能出现在 ``TEXT`` 或 ``TITLE``"
" 卡片上或字符串中，但在这些情况下前面必须带有 $。示例："

msgid "prints"
msgstr "打印"

msgid "``MCSCF results for R=1.5 Bohr``"
msgstr "``MCSCF results for R=1.5 Bohr``"

msgid ""
"String variables can be concatenated with strings or other string variables "
"in the following way. Assume that variable ``PROGRAM`` has the value "
"``MRCI``. Setting"
msgstr "字符串变量可以通过以下方式与字符串或其他字符串变量连接。假设变量 ``PROGRAM`` 的值为 ``MRCI``\\ 。设置"

msgid "``METHOD=’$PROGRAM+Q’``"
msgstr "``METHOD=’$PROGRAM+Q’``"

msgid ""
"sets ``METHOD`` to ``MRCI+Q``. Alternatively, if we would also have a "
"variable ``VERSION`` with value ``Q``, we could write"
msgstr ""
"将 ``METHOD`` 设置为 ``MRCI+Q``\\ 。或者，如果我们还有一个值为 ``Q`` 的变量 ``VERSION``\\ ，我们可以写成"

msgid "``METHOD=’$PROGRAM+$VERSION’``"
msgstr "``METHOD=’$PROGRAM+$VERSION’``"

msgid ""
"Again, the value of ``METHOD`` would be ``MRCI+Q``. Note that the quotes are"
" necessary in these cases."
msgstr "同样，\\ ``METHOD`` 的值将是 ``MRCI+Q``\\ 。请注意，在这些情况下引号是必需的。"

msgid "Substring operations are not implemented."
msgstr "未实现子字符串操作。"

msgid "System variables"
msgstr "系统变量"

msgid ""
"As mentioned above, most system variables cannot be written by the user. In "
"some exceptions, it is possible to redefine them using the ``SET`` command:"
msgstr "如上所述，大多数系统变量不能被用户写入。在某些例外情况下，可以使用 ``SET`` 命令重新定义它们："

msgid "This holds for the following variables:"
msgstr "这适用于以下变量："

msgid "``CHARGE`` Total charge of the molecule"
msgstr "``CHARGE`` 分子的总电荷"

msgid "``NELEC`` Number of electrons"
msgstr "``NELEC`` 电子数"

msgid "``SPIN`` Spin quantum number, given as :math:`2\\cdot M\\_S` (integer)"
msgstr "``SPIN`` 自旋量子数，以 :math:`2\\cdot M\\_S`\\ （整数）给出"

msgid "``SCFSPIN`` Same as ``SPIN``, but only for HF"
msgstr "``SCFSPIN`` 与 ``SPIN`` 相同，但仅适用于 HF"

msgid "``MCSPIN`` Same as ``SPIN``, but only for MCSCF"
msgstr "``MCSPIN`` 与 ``SPIN`` 相同，但仅用于 MCSCF"

msgid "``CISPIN`` Same as ``SPIN``, but only for MRCI"
msgstr "``CISPIN`` 与 ``SPIN`` 相同，但仅用于 MRCI"

msgid "``STATE`` State to be optimized"
msgstr "``STATE`` 待优化的态"

msgid "``MCSTATE`` Same as ``STATE`` but only for MCSCF"
msgstr "``MCSTATE`` 与 ``STATE`` 相同，但仅用于 MCSCF"

msgid "``CISTATE`` Same as ``STATE`` but only for MRCI"
msgstr "``CISTATE`` 与 ``STATE`` 相同，但仅用于 MRCI"

msgid "``SYMMETRY`` State symmetry"
msgstr "``SYMMETRY`` 态对称性"

msgid "``SCFSYM[METRY]`` Same as ``SYMMETRY`` but only for HF"
msgstr "``SCFSYM[METRY]`` 与 ``SYMMETRY`` 相同，但仅用于 HF"

msgid "``MCSYM[METRY]`` Same as ``SYMMETRY`` but only for MCSCF"
msgstr "``MCSYM[METRY]`` 与 ``SYMMETRY`` 相同，但仅用于 MCSCF"

msgid "``CISYM[METRY]`` Same as ``SYMMETRY`` but only for MRCI"
msgstr "``CISYM[METRY]`` 与 ``SYMMETRY`` 相同，但仅用于 MRCI"

msgid "``LQUANT`` Lambda quantum number for linear molecules"
msgstr "``LQUANT`` 线性分子的 Lambda 量子数"

msgid "``OPTCONV`` Geometry optimization convergence criterion"
msgstr "``OPTCONV`` 几何优化收敛判据"

msgid "``PROGRAM`` Last program name"
msgstr "``PROGRAM`` 上一个程序名称"

msgid "``CPUSTEP`` CPU-time of last program step"
msgstr "``CPUSTEP`` 上一个程序步骤的 CPU 时间"

msgid "``SYSSTEP`` System-time of last program step"
msgstr "``SYSSTEP`` 上一个程序步骤的系统时间"

msgid "``WALLSTEP`` Elapsed-time of last program step"
msgstr "``WALLSTEP`` 上一个程序步骤的流逝时间"

msgid "``FOCKDONE`` Indicates if closed-shell fock operator is available."
msgstr "``FOCKDONE`` 指示闭壳层 Fock 算符是否可用。"

msgid ""
"``MAXBASIS`` Max number of basis sets stored on dump files. If the maximum "
"is reached, the last one is overwritten when a new one is made, and all "
"information (including dump records etc) of the previous basis is lost. The "
"default is the maximum possible number of basis sets (30), which cannot be "
"exceeded."
msgstr ""
"``MAXBASIS`` "
"转储文件上存储的最大基组数量。如果达到最大值，当创建新基组时，最后一个会被覆盖，并且前一个基组的所有信息（包括转储记录等）都会丢失。默认值是最大可能的基组数量（30），此值不可超过。"

msgid "Macro definitions using string variables"
msgstr "使用字符串变量的宏定义"

msgid "``* This is string a+b which evaluates to 7``"
msgstr "``* This is string a+b which evaluates to 7``"

msgid ""
"This can be used to define simple macros, which can be used at various "
"places in the subsequent input. For instance,"
msgstr "这可用于定义简单的宏，这些宏可以在后续输入中的不同位置使用。例如，"

msgid "Here is an example of advanced use of macros and string variables:"
msgstr "以下是一个宏和字符串变量高级用法的示例："

msgid "Indexed Variables (Vectors)"
msgstr "索引变量（向量）"

msgid ""
"Variables may be indexed, but only one-dimensional arrays (vectors) are "
"supported. The index may itself be a variable. For instance"
msgstr "变量可以被索引，但仅支持一维数组（向量）。索引本身也可以是一个变量。例如"

msgid ""
"are valid variable definitions, provided ``I``, ``PROGRAM``, and ``ENERGY`` "
"are also defined variables. Indices may be nested to any depth."
msgstr "是有效的变量定义，前提是 ``I``\\ 、\\ ``PROGRAM`` 和 ``ENERGY`` 也是已定义的变量。索引可以嵌套到任意深度。"

msgid ""
"Different elements of an array can be of different type (either *real* or "
"*logical*). However, only one *unit* can be assigned to an array. String "
"variables have no associated value and cannot be mixed with the other "
"variable types. Therefore, a given variable name can only be used either for"
" a *string* variable or a *real* (*logical*) variable."
msgstr ""
"数组的不同元素可以是不同类型（\\ *实数* 或 *逻辑* 型）。但是，一个数组只能分配一个\\ *单位*\\ "
"。字符串变量没有关联值，不能与其他变量类型混合使用。因此，给定的变量名只能用于\\ *字符串*\\ 变量或\\ *实数*\\ （\\ *逻辑*\\ "
"）变量。"

msgid "Vectors (arrays) can be conveniently defined using square brackets:"
msgstr "向量（数组）可以使用方括号方便地定义："

msgid "``R=[1.0,1.2,1.3] ANG``"
msgstr "``R=[1.0,1.2,1.3] ANG``"

msgid ""
"This defines an array with three elements, which can be accessed using "
"indices; for instance, ``R(2)`` has the value ``1.2 ANG``. A repeat "
"specifier can be given in front of the left bracket: ``5[0]`` is equivalent "
"to ``[0,0,0,0,0]``. Brackets can even be nested: for instance, "
"``2[1,2,2[2.1,3.1]]`` is equivalent to "
"``[1,2,2.1,3.1,2.1,3.1,1,2,2.1,3.1,2.1,3.1]``."
msgstr ""
"这定义了一个包含三个元素的数组，可以通过索引访问；例如，\\ ``R(2)`` 的值为 ``1.2 ANG``\\ 。可以在左括号前指定重复说明符：\\"
" ``5[0]`` 等价于 ``[0,0,0,0,0]``\\ 。括号甚至可以嵌套：例如，\\ ``2[1,2,2[2.1,3.1]]`` 等价于 "
"``[1,2,2.1,3.1,2.1,3.1,1,2,2.1,3.1,2.1,3.1]``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Arrays can be appended from a given position just by entering additional "
"elements; for instance,"
msgstr "数组可以从给定位置通过输入额外元素来追加；例如，"

msgid "``R(4)=[1.4,1.5] ANG``"
msgstr "``R(4)=[1.4,1.5] ANG``"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "``R(4:)=[1.4,1.5] ANG``"
msgstr "``R(4:)=[1.4,1.5] ANG``"

msgid ""
"extends the above array to length 5. Previously defined values can be "
"overwritten. For instance"
msgstr "将上述数组扩展至长度为 5。先前定义的值可以被覆盖。例如"

msgid "``R(2)=[1.25,1.35,1.45]``"
msgstr "``R(2)=[1.25,1.35,1.45]``"

msgid "modifies the above vector to (1.0, 1.25, 1.35, 1.45, 1.5)."
msgstr "将上述向量修改为 (1.0, 1.25, 1.35, 1.45, 1.5)。"

msgid ""
"If no index is given on the left hand side of the equal sign, an existing "
"variable of the same name is replaced by the new values, and all old values "
"are lost. For instance"
msgstr "如果等号左侧未指定索引，则同名的现有变量将被新值替换，所有旧值都将丢失。例如"

msgid "``THETA=[100,110,120,130]`` set four values"
msgstr "``THETA=[100,110,120,130]`` 设置四个值"

msgid ""
"``THETA(1)=104`` replace ``THETA(1)`` by a new value; ``THETA(2:4)`` are "
"unchanged"
msgstr "``THETA(1)=104`` 将 ``THETA(1)`` 替换为新值；\\ ``THETA(2:4)`` 保持不变"

msgid ""
"``THETA=[140,150]`` old variable ``THETA`` is replaced; ``THETA(3:4)`` are "
"deleted"
msgstr "``THETA=[140,150]`` 旧变量 ``THETA`` 被替换；\\ ``THETA(3:4)`` 被删除"

msgid "Square brackets can also be used to define an array of strings, e.g.,"
msgstr "方括号也可用于定义字符串数组，例如，"

msgid "``METHOD=[INT,HF,CASSCF,MRCI]``"
msgstr "``METHOD=[INT,HF,CASSCF,MRCI]``"

msgid "These could be used as follows:"
msgstr "这些可以如下使用："

msgid "The above input would be equivalent to"
msgstr "上述输入等价于"

msgid ""
"The current length of an array can be accessed by preceding ``#`` to the "
"variable name. For instance, in the above examples ``#R`` and ``#METHOD`` "
"have the values 5 and 4, respectively. If a variable is not defined, zero is"
" returned but no error occurs. This can be used to test for the existence of"
" a variable, for example:"
msgstr ""
"数组的当前长度可以通过在变量名前加上 ``#`` 来访问。例如，在上述示例中，\\ ``#R`` 和 ``#METHOD`` 的值分别为 5 和 "
"4。如果变量未定义，则返回零但不会发生错误。这可用于测试变量是否存在，例如："

msgid "``IF(#SPIN.EQ.0.AND.#NELEC.EQ.1) SET,SPIN=MOD(NELEC,2)``"
msgstr "``IF(#SPIN.EQ.0.AND.#NELEC.EQ.1) SET,SPIN=MOD(NELEC,2)``"

msgid ""
"This defines variable ``SPIN`` if it is unknown and if ``NELEC`` is a scalar"
" (one dimensional) variable."
msgstr "如果变量 ``SPIN`` 未知且 ``NELEC`` 是标量（一维）变量，则此语句定义变量 ``SPIN``\\ 。"

msgid "Vector operations"
msgstr "向量运算"

msgid "The following simple vector operations are possible:"
msgstr "以下简单的向量运算是可行的："

msgid ""
"Copying or appending a vector to another vector. For instance ``S=R`` copies"
" a vector ``R`` to a vector ``S``. ``S(3)=R`` copies ``R`` to ``S(3), S(4), "
"…``. ``S(#S+1)=R`` appends vector ``R`` to vector ``S``. It is also possible"
" to access a range of subsequent elements in a vector: ``S=R(2:4)`` copies "
"elements 2 to 4 of ``R`` to ``S(1), S(2), S(3)``. Note that ``R(2:)`` "
"denotes elements ``R(2)`` to ``R(#R)``, but ``R(2)`` denotes a single "
"element of ``R``."
msgstr ""
"复制向量或将向量附加到另一个向量。例如，\\ ``S=R`` 将向量 ``R`` 复制到向量 ``S``\\ 。\\ ``S(3)=R`` 将 "
"``R`` 复制到 ``S(3), S(4), …``\\ 。\\ ``S(#S+1)=R`` 将向量 ``R`` 附加到向量 ``S``\\ "
"。也可以访问向量中连续的元素范围：\\ ``S=R(2:4)`` 将 ``R`` 的第 2 到第 4 个元素复制到 ``S(1), S(2), "
"S(3)``\\ 。请注意，\\ ``R(2:)`` 表示元素 ``R(2)`` 到 ``R(#R)``\\ ，但 ``R(2)`` 表示 ``R`` "
"的单个元素。"

msgid ""
"Vector-scalar operations: ``R=R*2`` multiplies each element of ``R`` by 2. "
"Instead of the number 2, also scalar (one dimensional) variables or "
"expressions can be used, e.g., ``R=R*ANG`` converts all elements of ``R`` "
"from Ångstrøm to bohr, or ``Z=R*COS(THETA)`` creates a vector ``Z`` with "
"elements ``Z(i) = R(i)*COS(THETA)``. All other algebraic operators can be "
"used instead of “\\*”. Note that the scalar must come last since the first "
"variable in the expression determines the vector length."
msgstr ""
"向量-标量运算：\\ ``R=R*2`` 将 ``R`` 的每个元素乘以 2。除了数字 2，也可以使用标量（一维）变量或表达式，例如，\\ "
"``R=R*ANG`` 将 ``R`` 的所有元素从 Ångstrøm 转换为 bohr，或者 ``Z=R*COS(THETA)`` 创建一个向量 "
"``Z``\\ ，其元素为 ``Z(i) = R(i)*COS(THETA)``\\ "
"。所有其他代数运算符都可以用来代替“\\*”。请注意，标量必须放在最后，因为表达式中的第一个变量决定了向量长度。"

msgid ""
"Vector-vector operations: If ``A`` and ``B`` are vectors of the same length,"
" then ``A \\times B`` is also a vector of this length. Here :math:`\\times` "
"stands for any algebraic operator, and the operation is done for each pair "
"of corresponding elements. For instance, ``A + B`` adds the vectors ``A`` "
"and ``B``, and ``A * B`` multiplies their elements. Note that the latter "
"case is not a scalar product. If an attempt is made to connect two vectors "
"of different lengths by an algebraic operator, an error occurs."
msgstr ""
"向量-向量运算：如果 ``A`` 和 ``B`` 是长度相同的向量，那么 ``A \\times B`` 也是一个相同长度的向量。这里 "
":math:`\\times` 代表任何代数运算符，运算针对每一对对应元素进行。例如，\\ ``A + B`` 将向量 ``A`` 和 ``B`` "
"相加，\\ ``A * B`` 将它们的元素相乘。请注意，后一种情况不是标量积。如果尝试用代数运算符连接两个长度不同的向量，则会发生错误。"

msgid ""
"Intrinsic functions: Assume ``THETA=[100,110,120,-130]`` to be a vector of "
"angles (in degrees). In this case ``X=2*COS(THETA)`` is also a vector "
"containing the cosines of each element of ``THETA`` multiplied by two, i.e.,"
" ``X(i) = 2*COS(THETA(i))``. ``MAX(THETA)`` or ``MIN(THETA)`` return the "
"maximum and minimum values, respectively, in array ``THETA``. Vector "
"operations can also be nested, e.g., ``MAX(ABS(THETA))`` returns the maximum"
" value in array ``ABS(THETA)``."
msgstr ""
"内置函数：假设 ``THETA=[100,110,120,-130]`` 是一个角度向量（以度为单位）。在这种情况下，\\ "
"``X=2*COS(THETA)`` 也是一个向量，包含 ``THETA`` 每个元素的余弦值乘以二，即 ``X(i) = "
"2*COS(THETA(i))``\\ 。\\ ``MAX(THETA)`` 或 ``MIN(THETA)`` 分别返回数组 ``THETA`` "
"中的最大值和最小值。向量运算也可以嵌套，例如，\\ ``MAX(ABS(THETA))`` 返回数组 ``ABS(THETA)`` 中的最大值。"

msgid ""
"At present, vector operations are not supported with ``string`` variables."
msgstr "目前，向量运算不支持 ``string`` 类型的变量。"

msgid "Special variables"
msgstr "特殊变量"

msgid ""
"A number of variables are predefined by the program. The following variables"
" can be used to convert between atomic units and other units:"
msgstr "程序预定义了许多变量。以下变量可用于在原子单位和其他单位之间进行转换："

msgid "Further variables which are set during execution of the program:"
msgstr "程序执行期间设置的更多变量："

msgid ""
"``INTYP`` defines integral program to be used. Either ``INTS`` (Seward) or "
"``INTP`` (Argos)."
msgstr "``INTYP`` 定义要使用的积分程序。可以是 ``INTS`` (Seward) 或 ``INTP`` (Argos)。"

msgid ""
"``INTDONE`` has the value ``.true.`` if the integrals are done for the "
"current geometry."
msgstr "如果当前几何结构的积分已完成，\\ ``INTDONE`` 的值为 ``.true.``\\ 。"

msgid "``CARTESIAN`` Set to one if Cartesian basis functions are used."
msgstr "``CARTESIAN`` 如果使用笛卡尔基函数，则设置为 1。"

msgid ""
"``SCFDONE`` has the value ``.true.`` if an SCF calculation has been done for"
" the current geometry."
msgstr "如果已对当前几何结构完成 SCF 计算，\\ ``SCFDONE`` 的值为 ``.true.``\\ 。"

msgid "``NUMVAR`` number of variables presently defined"
msgstr "``NUMVAR`` 当前定义的变量数量"

msgid ""
"``STATUS`` status of last step (1=no error, -1=error or no convergence)"
msgstr "``STATUS`` 最后一步的状态 (1=无错误, -1=错误或未收敛)"

msgid "``NELEC`` number of electrons in last wavefunction"
msgstr "``NELEC`` 最后一个波函数中的电子数"

msgid "``SPIN`` spin multiplicity minus one of last wavefunction"
msgstr "``SPIN`` 最后一个波函数的自旋多重度减一"

msgid ""
"``ORBITAL`` record of last optimized orbitals (set but never used in the "
"program)"
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 最后一次优化轨道的记录（已设置但程序中从未使用）"

msgid ""
"``LASTORB`` Type of last optimized orbitals (``RHF``, ``UHF``, ``UHFNAT``, "
"or ``MCSCF``)."
msgstr ""
"``LASTORB`` 最后一次优化轨道的类型（\\ ``RHF``\\ 、\\ ``UHF``\\ 、\\ ``UHFNAT`` 或 "
"``MCSCF``\\ ）。"

msgid "``LASTSYM`` Symmetry of wavefunction for last optimized orbitals."
msgstr "``LASTSYM`` 最后一次优化轨道对应的波函数的对称性。"

msgid ""
"``LASTSPIN`` :math:`2*M_S` for wavefunctions for last optimized orbitals."
msgstr "``LASTSPIN`` 最后一次优化轨道对应的波函数的 :math:`2*M_S`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``LASTNELEC`` Number of electrons in wavefunction for last optimized "
"orbitals."
msgstr "``LASTNELEC`` 上次优化轨道对应的波函数中的电子数。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGR(istate)`` Reference energy for state *istate* in MRCI and CCSD."
msgstr "``ENERGR(istate)`` MRCI 和 CCSD 中状态 *istate* 的参考能量。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGY(istate)`` last computed total energy for state *istate* for the "
"method specified in the input (e.g., ``HF``, ``MULTI``, ``CCSD(T)``, or "
"``CCSD[T]``."
msgstr ""
"``ENERGY(istate)`` 根据输入中指定的方法（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ ``MULTI``\\ 、\\ ``CCSD(T)`` 或 "
"``CCSD[T]``\\ ）最后计算得到的状态 *istate* 的总能量。"

msgid "``ENERGY_AVRG`` State-averaged energy of the MCSCF program multi."
msgstr "``ENERGY_AVRG`` MCSCF 程序 multi 的态平均能量。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGY_METHOD`` String variable holding name of the method used for "
"calculating ``ENERGY``"
msgstr "``ENERGY_METHOD`` 字符串变量，保存用于计算 ``ENERGY`` 的方法名称。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGY_BASIS`` String variable holding name of the orbital basis-set used "
"for calculating ``ENERGY``"
msgstr "``ENERGY_BASIS`` 字符串变量，保存用于计算 ``ENERGY`` 的轨道基组名称。"

msgid ""
"``GEOMETRY_METHOD`` Equal to the value of ``ENERGY_METHOD`` for the most "
"recent geometry optimisation"
msgstr "``GEOMETRY_METHOD`` 等于最近一次几何优化时 ``ENERGY_METHOD`` 的值。"

msgid ""
"``GEOMETRY_BASIS`` Equal to the value of ``ENERGY_BASIS`` for the most "
"recent geometry optimisation"
msgstr "``GEOMETRY_BASIS`` 等于最近一次几何优化时 ``ENERGY_BASIS`` 的值。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGD(istate)`` Total energy for state *istate* including Davidson "
"correction (set only in ``CI``)."
msgstr "``ENERGD(istate)`` 包含 Davidson 校正的态 *istate* 的总能量（仅在 ``CI`` 中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGP(istate)`` Total energy for state *istate* including Pople "
"correction (set only in ``CI``)."
msgstr "``ENERGP(istate)`` 包含 Pople 校正的态 *istate* 的总能量（仅在 ``CI`` 中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT(1)`` Total energy including perturbative triples ``(T)`` correction"
" (set only in ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)``)."
msgstr "``ENERGT(1)`` 包含微扰三重激发 ``(T)`` 校正的总能量（仅在 ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)`` 中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT(2)`` Total energy including perturbative triples ``[T]`` correction"
" (set only in ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)``)."
msgstr "``ENERGT(2)`` 包含微扰三重激发 ``[T]`` 校正的总能量（仅在 ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)`` 中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT(3)`` Total energy including perturbative triples ``-t`` correction "
"(set only in ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)``)."
msgstr "``ENERGT(3)`` 包含微扰三重激发 ``-t`` 校正的总能量（仅在 ``CCSD(T), QCI(T)`` 中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2`` holds MP2 energy in MPn, CCSD, BCCD, or QCISD calculations, and RS2"
" energy in MRPT2 (CASPT2) calculations."
msgstr ""
"``EMP2`` 在 MPn、CCSD、BCCD 或 QCISD 计算中保存 MP2 能量，在 MRPT2 (CASPT2) 计算中保存 RS2 能量。"

msgid ""
"``EMP3`` holds MP3 energy in MP3 and MP4 calculations, and RS3 energy in "
"MRPR3 (CASPT3) calculations."
msgstr "``EMP3`` 在 MP3 和 MP4 计算中保存 MP3 能量，在 MRPR3 (CASPT3) 计算中保存 RS3 能量。"

msgid ""
"``EMP4`` holds MP4(SDQ) energy in MP4 calculations. The MP4(SDTQ) energy is "
"stored in variable ``ENERGY``."
msgstr "``EMP4`` 在 MP4 计算中保存 MP4(SDQ) 能量。MP4(SDTQ) 能量存储在变量 ``ENERGY`` 中。"

msgid ""
"``METHODC`` String variable holding name of the methods used for ``ENERGC``,"
" e.g., ``CCSD, BCCD, QCI``."
msgstr "``METHODC`` 字符串变量，保存用于 ``ENERGC`` 的方法名称，例如 ``CCSD, BCCD, QCI``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``METHODT(1)`` String variable holding name of the methods used for "
"``ENERGT(1)``, e.g., ``CCSD(T), BCCD(T), QCI(T)``."
msgstr ""
"``METHODT(1)`` 字符串变量，保存用于 ``ENERGT(1)`` 的方法名称，例如 ``CCSD(T), BCCD(T), "
"QCI(T)``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``METHODT(2)`` String variable holding name of the methods used for "
"``ENERGT(2)``, e.g., ``CCSD[T], BCCD[T], QCI[T]``."
msgstr ""
"``METHODT(2)`` 字符串变量，保存用于 ``ENERGT(2)`` 的方法名称，例如 ``CCSD[T], BCCD[T], "
"QCI[T]``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``METHODT(3)`` String variable holding name of the methods used for "
"``ENERGT(3)``, e.g., ``CCSD-T, BCCD-T, QCI-T``."
msgstr ""
"``METHODT(3)`` 字符串变量，保存用于 ``ENERGT(3)`` 的方法名称，例如 ``CCSD-T, BCCD-T, QCI-T``\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGC`` Total energy excluding perturbative triples correction (set only "
"in ``QCI`` or ``CCSD`` with triples correction enabled)."
msgstr "``ENERGC`` 不包含微扰三重激发校正的总能量（仅在启用三重激发校正的 ``QCI`` 或 ``CCSD`` 计算中设置）。"

msgid "``DFTFUN`` total value of density functional in ``DFT`` or ``KS``."
msgstr "``DFTFUN`` ``DFT`` 或 ``KS`` 中密度泛函的总值。"

msgid ""
"``DFTFUNS(ifun)`` value of ``ifun``\\ ’th component of density functional in"
" ``DFT`` or ``KS``."
msgstr "``DFTFUNS(ifun)`` ``DFT`` 或 ``KS`` 中密度泛函第 ``ifun``\\ 个分量的值。"

msgid ""
"``DFTNAME(ifun)`` name of ``ifun``\\ ’th component of density functional in "
"``DFT`` or ``KS``."
msgstr "``DFTNAME(ifun)`` ``DFT`` 或 ``KS`` 中密度泛函第 ``ifun``\\ 个分量的名称。"

msgid ""
"``DFTFAC(ifun)`` factor multiplying ``ifun``\\ ’th component of density "
"functional in ``DFT`` or ``KS``."
msgstr "``DFTFAC(ifun)`` 在 ``DFT`` 或 ``KS`` 中乘以第 ``ifun`` 个密度泛函分量的因子。"

msgid "``DFTEXFAC`` factor multiplying exact exchange in ``KS``."
msgstr "``DFTEXFAC`` 在 ``KS`` 中乘以精确交换的因子。"

msgid ""
"``PROP(istate)`` computed property for state *istate*. See below for the "
"names ``PROP`` of various properties."
msgstr "``PROP(istate)`` 为状态 *istate* 计算的性质。各种性质的名称 ``PROP`` 见下文。"

msgid ""
"``PROGRAM`` last program called, as specified in the input (e.g., ``HF``, "
"``CCSD(T)``, etc.)"
msgstr "``PROGRAM`` 最后调用的程序，如输入中所指定（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ ``CCSD(T)`` 等）。"

msgid ""
"``ITERATIONS`` Number of iterations used. Set negative if no convergence or "
"max number of iterations reached."
msgstr "``ITERATIONS`` 使用的迭代次数。如果未收敛或达到最大迭代次数，则设置为负值。"

msgid "``CPUSTEP`` User-CPU time in seconds for last program called."
msgstr "``CPUSTEP`` 最后调用程序的用户CPU时间（秒）。"

msgid "``SYSSTEP`` System-CPU time in seconds for last program called."
msgstr "``SYSSTEP`` 最后调用程序的系统CPU时间（秒）。"

msgid "``WALLSTEP`` Elapsed time in seconds for last program called."
msgstr "``WALLSTEP`` 最后调用程序的经过时间（秒）。"

msgid ""
"The variable names for properties are the same as used on the ``EXPEC`` "
"input cards."
msgstr "属性的变量名与 ``EXPEC`` 输入卡片中使用的名称相同。"

msgid "``OV`` Overlap"
msgstr "``OV`` 重叠"

msgid "``EKIN`` Kinetic energy"
msgstr "``EKIN`` 动能"

msgid "``POT`` Potential"
msgstr "``POT`` 势能"

msgid "``DELTA`` Delta function"
msgstr "``DELTA`` Delta 函数"

msgid "``DEL4`` :math:`\\nabla^4`"
msgstr "``DEL4`` :math:`\\nabla^4`"

msgid "``DARWIN`` Darwin term of relativistic correction"
msgstr "``DARWIN`` 相对论校正的达尔文项"

msgid "``MASSV`` Mass-velocity term of relativistic correction"
msgstr "``MASSV`` 相对论校正的质量-速度项"

msgid "``EREL`` Total relativistic correction"
msgstr "``EREL`` 总相对论校正"

msgid "``XX, YY, ZZ, XY, XZ, XY`` Second moments"
msgstr "``XX, YY, ZZ, XY, XZ, XY`` 二阶矩"

msgid "``XXX, XXY, XXZ, XYY, XYZ, XZZ, YYY, YYZ, YZZ, ZZZ`` Third moments"
msgstr "``XXX, XXY, XXZ, XYY, XYZ, XZZ, YYY, YYZ, YZZ, ZZZ`` 三阶矩"

msgid "``QMXX, QMYY, QMZZ, QMXY, QMXZ, QMXY`` Quadrupole moments"
msgstr "``QMXX, QMYY, QMZZ, QMXY, QMXZ, QMXY`` 四极矩"

msgid "``EFX, EFY, EFZ`` Electric field"
msgstr "``EFX, EFY, EFZ`` 电场"

msgid "``FGXX, FGYY, FGZZ, FGXY, FGXZ, FGXY`` Electric field gradients"
msgstr "``FGXX, FGYY, FGZZ, FGXY, FGXZ, FGXY`` 电场梯度"

msgid "``D/DX, D/DY, D/DZ`` Velocity"
msgstr "``D/DX, D/DY, D/DZ`` 速度"

msgid "``LSX, LSY, LSZ`` One-electron spin-orbit"
msgstr "``LSX, LSY, LSZ`` 单电子自旋轨道"

msgid "``LL`` Total angular momentum squared :math:`L^2`"
msgstr "``LL`` 总角动量平方 :math:`L^2`"

msgid "``LX, LY, LZ`` Electronic angular momentum"
msgstr "``LX, LY, LZ`` 电子角动量"

msgid "``LXLX, LYLY, LZLZ, LXLY, LXLZ, LYLZ`` Two-electron angular momentum"
msgstr "``LXLX, LYLY, LZLZ, LXLY, LXLZ, LYLZ`` 双电子角动量"

msgid ""
"By default, only the dipole moments are computed and defined. The values of "
"other properties are only stored in variables if they are requested by "
"``EXPEC`` cards. If more than one state is computed (e.g., in state-averaged"
" MCSCF, corresponding arrays ``PROP(istate)`` are returned. If properties "
"are computed for more than one center, the center number is appended to the "
"name, e.g. ``EFX1``, ``EFX2`` etc."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，仅计算并定义偶极矩。其他属性的值仅在通过 ``EXPEC`` 卡片请求时才存储到变量中。如果计算了多个态（例如，在态平均 MCSCF "
"中），则返回相应的数组 ``PROP(istate)``\\ 。如果为多个中心计算了属性，则中心编号会附加到名称后，例如 ``EFX1``\\ 、\\ "
"``EFX2`` 等。"

msgid ""
"If transition properties are computed, their values are stored in "
"corresponding variables with prefix ``TR``, e.g., ``TRDMX, TRDMY, TRDMZ`` "
"for transition dipole moments. If more than two states are computed, the "
"index is :math:`(i-1)*(i-2)/2+j`, where :math:`i \\gt j \\ge 1` are state "
"numbers. In a state-averaged calculation, states are counted sequentially "
"for all state symmetries."
msgstr ""
"如果计算了跃迁属性，它们的值将存储在带有前缀 ``TR`` 的相应变量中，例如，跃迁偶极矩的 ``TRDMX, TRDMY, TRDMZ``\\ "
"。如果计算了两个以上的态，则索引为 :math:`(i-1)*(i-2)/2+j`\\ ，其中 :math:`i \\gt j \\ge 1` "
"是态编号。在态平均计算中，态按所有态对称性顺序计数。"

msgid "For instance, in the following state-averaged MCSCF"
msgstr "例如，在以下态平均 MCSCF 中"

msgid "``MULTI;WF,14,1,0;STATE,3;WF,14,2,0;STATE,2;WF,14,3,0``"
msgstr "``MULTI;WF,14,1,0;STATE,3;WF,14,2,0;STATE,2;WF,14,3,0``"

msgid "the states are counted as"
msgstr "态按以下方式计数"

msgid ":math:`i`"
msgstr ":math:`i`"

msgid "Symmetry"
msgstr "对称性"

msgid "Root in Sym."
msgstr "对称性中的根"

msgid "Variables recognized by the program"
msgstr "程序识别的变量"

msgid ""
"All variables described below are checked by the program, but not set "
"(except ``NELEC`` and ``SPIN``). If these are not defined by the user, the "
"program uses its internal defaults. The variables are only recognized and "
"used if defined using the ``SET`` command, e.g."
msgstr ""
"下文描述的所有变量均由程序检查，但不设置（\\ ``NELEC`` 和 ``SPIN`` "
"除外）。如果用户未定义这些变量，程序将使用其内部默认值。变量仅在通过 ``SET`` 命令定义时被识别和使用，例如，"

msgid "etc."
msgstr "等等。"

msgid "Variables recognized by the SCF program:"
msgstr "SCF 程序识别的变量："

msgid ""
"``CHARGE`` Total charge of the molecule (can be given instead of nelec)"
msgstr "``CHARGE`` 分子的总电荷（可替代 nelec 给出）"

msgid "``NELEC`` number of electrons"
msgstr "``NELEC`` 电子数"

msgid "``SPIN`` spin multiplicity minus one"
msgstr "``SPIN`` 自旋多重度减一"

msgid "``SCFSYM[METRY]`` wavefunction symmetry"
msgstr "``SCFSYM[METRY]`` 波函数对称性"

msgid "``SCFOC[C]`` number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry for ``SCF``"
msgstr "``SCFOC[C]`` 每个对称性中用于\\ ``SCF``\\ 的占据轨道数量"

msgid ""
"``SCFCL[OSED]`` number of closed-shell orbitals in each symmetry for ``SCF``"
msgstr "``SCFCL[OSED]`` ``SCF`` 中每个对称性下的闭壳层轨道数"

msgid "``SCFORB`` record of saved orbitals in ``SCF``"
msgstr "``SCFORB`` ``SCF`` 中保存的轨道记录"

msgid "``SCFSTART`` record of starting orbitals used in ``SCF``"
msgstr "``SCFSTART`` ``SCF`` 中使用的起始轨道记录"

msgid "Variables recognized by the MCSCF program:"
msgstr "MCSCF 程序识别的变量："

msgid ""
"``MCSYM[METRY]`` wavefunction symmetry. This can be an array for state-"
"averaged calculations."
msgstr "``MCSYM[METRY]`` 波函数对称性。对于态平均计算，可以是一个数组。"

msgid "``SYMMETRY`` as ``MCSYMM``; only used if ``MCSYMM`` is not present."
msgstr "``SYMMETRY`` 作为 ``MCSYMM``\\ ；仅在 ``MCSYMM`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid ""
"``MCSPIN`` spin multiplicity minus one. This can be an array for state-"
"averaged calculations, but different spin multiplicities can only be used in"
" determinant CASSCF. If only one value is specified, this is used for all "
"states"
msgstr ""
"``MCSPIN`` 自旋多重度减一。对于态平均计算，可以是一个数组，但不同的自旋多重度只能在行列式 CASSCF "
"中使用。如果只指定一个值，则该值用于所有态。"

msgid "``SPIN`` as ``MCSPIN``; only used if ``MCSPIN`` is not present."
msgstr "``SPIN`` 作为 ``MCSPIN``\\ ；仅在 ``MCSPIN`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``MCSTATE`` number of states for each symmetry in ``MCSCF``"
msgstr "``MCSTATE`` 在 ``MCSCF`` 中每个对称性的状态数"

msgid "``STATE`` as ``MCSTATE``; only used if ``MCSTATE`` is not present."
msgstr "``STATE`` 同 ``MCSTATE``\\ ；仅在 ``MCSTATE`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid ""
"``WEIGHT`` weight factors for all states defined by ``SYMMETRY`` and "
"``STATE``"
msgstr "``WEIGHT`` 由 ``SYMMETRY`` 和 ``STATE`` 定义的所有状态的权重因子"

msgid ""
"``LQUANT`` Eigenvalues of :math:`L_z^2` for linear molecules for each state "
"defined by ``SYMMETRY`` and ``STATE``."
msgstr ""
"``LQUANT`` 对于由 ``SYMMETRY`` 和 ``STATE`` 定义的每个状态，线性分子的 :math:`L_z^2` 的本征值。"

msgid ""
"``MCSELECT`` records from which configurations can be selected and selection"
" threshold"
msgstr "``MCSELECT`` 记录可以从哪些构型中选择以及选择阈值"

msgid "``SELECT`` as ``MCSELECT``; only used if ``MCSELECT`` is not present."
msgstr "``SELECT`` 同 ``MCSELECT``\\ ；仅在 ``MCSELECT`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``MCRESTRICT`` can be used to define occupancy restrictions"
msgstr "``MCRESTRICT`` 可用于定义占据限制"

msgid ""
"``RESTRICT`` as ``MCRESTRCT``; only used if ``MCRESTRICT`` is not present:"
msgstr "``RESTRICT`` 同 ``MCRESTRCT``\\ ；仅在 ``MCRESTRICT`` 不存在时使用："

msgid "``CONFIG`` if set to .true. or to one triggers use of CSFs"
msgstr "``CONFIG`` 若设置为 .true. 或 1 则触发使用 CSFs"

msgid "``MCOC[C]`` number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``MCOC[C]`` 每个对称性中的占据轨道数"

msgid "``OCC`` as ``MCOCC``; only used if ``MCOCC`` is not present."
msgstr "``OCC`` 作为 ``MCOCC``\\ ；仅在 ``MCOCC`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid ""
"``MCCL[OSED]`` number of optimized closed-shell orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``MCCL[OSED]`` 每个对称性中优化的闭壳层轨道数"

msgid "``CLOSED`` as ``MCCLOSED``; only used if ``MCCLOSED`` is not present."
msgstr "``CLOSED`` 作为 ``MCCLOSED``\\ ；仅在 ``MCCLOSED`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``MCFROZEN`` number of frozen core orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``MCFROZEN`` 每个对称性中的冻结芯轨道数"

msgid "``FROZEN`` as ``MCFROZEN``; only used if ``MCFROZEN`` is not present."
msgstr "``FROZEN`` 作为 ``MCFROZEN``\\ ；仅在 ``MCFROZEN`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``MCSTART`` record of starting orbitals"
msgstr "``MCSTART`` 起始轨道记录"

msgid "``COREORB`` record of frozen core orbitals"
msgstr "``COREORB`` 冻结芯轨道记录"

msgid "``MCORB`` record for saving optimized orbitals"
msgstr "``MCORB`` 保存优化轨道的记录"

msgid ""
"``MCSAVE`` records for saving CI wavefunction (like ``SAVE`` card in MCSCF)"
msgstr "``MCSAVE`` 保存 CI 波函数的记录（类似于 MCSCF 中的 ``SAVE`` 卡片）"

msgid "Variables recognized by the CI/CCSD program:"
msgstr "CI/CCSD 程序识别的变量："

msgid ""
"``CISYM[METRY]`` wavefunction symmetry. If this is an array, only "
"SYMMETRY(1) is used."
msgstr "``CISYM[METRY]`` 波函数对称性。如果这是一个数组，则仅使用 SYMMETRY(1)。"

msgid "``SYMMETRY`` as ``CISYMM``; only used if ``CISYMM`` is not present."
msgstr "``SYMMETRY`` 作为 ``CISYMM``\\ ；仅在 ``CISYMM`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CISTATE`` number of states in CI"
msgstr "``CISTATE`` CI 中的态数"

msgid "``STATE`` as ``CISTATE``, only used if ``CISTATE`` is not present."
msgstr "``STATE`` 作为 ``CISTATE``\\ ，仅在 ``CISTATE`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CISELECT`` records from which configurations can be selected"
msgstr "``CISELECT`` 记录可从哪些构型中进行选择"

msgid "``SELECT`` as ``CISELECT``; only used if ``CISELCT`` is not present."
msgstr "``SELECT`` 同 ``CISELECT``\\ ；仅在 ``CISELCT`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CIRESTRICT`` defines occupancy restrictions"
msgstr "``CIRESTRICT`` 定义占据数限制"

msgid ""
"``RESTRICT`` as ``RESTRICT``; only used if ``CIRESTRICT`` is not present."
msgstr "``RESTRICT`` 同 ``RESTRICT``\\ ；仅在 ``CIRESTRICT`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CIOC[C]`` number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``CIOC[C]`` 每个对称性中的占据轨道数量"

msgid "``OCC`` ``as CIOCC``; only used if ``CIOCC`` is not present."
msgstr "``OCC`` ``as CIOCC``\\ ；仅在 ``CIOCC`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CICL[OSED]`` number of closed-shell orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``CICL[OSED]`` 每个对称性中的闭壳层轨道数量"

msgid "``CLOSED`` ``as CICLOSED``; only used if ``CICLOSED`` is not present."
msgstr "``CLOSED`` ``as CICLOSED``\\ ；仅在 ``CICLOSED`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CICO[RE]`` number of core orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``CICO[RE]`` 每个对称性中的芯轨道数量"

msgid "``CORE`` ``as CICORE``; only used if ``CICORE`` is not present."
msgstr "``CORE`` ``as CICORE``\\ ；仅在 ``CICORE`` 不存在时使用。"

msgid "``CIORB`` record of orbitals used in CI"
msgstr "``CIORB`` CI中使用的轨道记录"

msgid ""
"``CISAVE`` records for saving CI wavefunction (like ``SAVE`` card in CI)"
msgstr "``CISAVE`` 用于保存CI波函数的记录（类似CI中的\\ ``SAVE``\\ 卡片）"

msgid ""
"``CISTART`` records for restarting with previous CI wavefunction (like "
"``START`` card in CI)"
msgstr "``CISTART`` 用于从先前的 CI 波函数重新启动的记录（类似于 CI 中的 ``START`` 卡片）"

msgid "Variables recognized by the DFT/KS program:"
msgstr "DFT/KS 程序识别的变量："

msgid ""
"``DFTFAC(ifun)`` factor multiplying ``ifun``\\ ’th component of density "
"functional."
msgstr "``DFTFAC(ifun)`` 乘以密度泛函第 ``ifun`` 个组分的因子。"

msgid ""
"Example for the use of these variables for a state-averaged MCSCF (note that"
" system variables can only be modified using the SET command, see section "
"`system variables <variables.html#system-variables>`__):"
msgstr ""
"这些变量用于态平均 MCSCF 的示例（注意系统变量只能使用 SET 命令修改，参见 `system variables "
"<variables.html#system-variables>`__ 章节）："

msgid "``SET,NELEC=9`` defines number of electrons"
msgstr "``SET,NELEC=9`` 定义电子数"

msgid "``SET,SPIN=1`` defines wavefunction to be a doublet"
msgstr "``SET,SPIN=1`` 定义波函数为双重态"

msgid ""
"``SET,SYMMETRY=[1,2,3]`` defines wavefunction symmetries for state averaged "
"calculation"
msgstr "``SET,SYMMETRY=[1,2,3]`` 定义态平均计算中波函数的对称性"

msgid ""
"``SET,STATE=[2,1,1]`` defines number of states to be averaged in each "
"symmetry"
msgstr "``SET,STATE=[2,1,1]`` 定义每个对称性中要平均的态的数量"

msgid "``WEIGHT=[2,2,1,1]`` defines weights for the above four states"
msgstr "``WEIGHT=[2,2,1,1]`` 定义上述四个态的权重"

msgid "``OCC=[5,2,2]`` number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "``OCC=[5,2,2]`` 每个对称性中占据轨道的数量"

msgid "``CLOSED=2`` number of closed-shell orbitals in symmetry 1"
msgstr "``CLOSED=2`` 对称性 1 中闭壳层轨道的数量"

msgid "``MCORB=3100.2`` record for optimized orbitals"
msgstr "``MCORB=3100.2`` 优化轨道的记录"

msgid "``MULTI`` do mcscf with above parameters"
msgstr "``MULTI`` 使用上述参数进行MCSCF计算"

msgid "Displaying variables"
msgstr "显示变量"

msgid ""
"Variables or the results of expressions can be displayed in the output using"
" ``SHOW`` and ``TABLE``."
msgstr "可以使用 ``SHOW`` 和 ``TABLE`` 在输出中显示变量或表达式的结果。"

msgid "The SHOW command"
msgstr "SHOW命令"

msgid "The general form of the ``SHOW`` command is as follows:"
msgstr "``SHOW`` 命令的一般形式如下："

msgid "``SHOW[ncol,format],expression``"
msgstr "``SHOW[ncol,format],expression``"

msgid ""
"where *expression* can be an expression or variable, *ncol* is the number of"
" values printed per line (default 6), and *format* is a format (default "
"6F15.8). This can be used to print vectors in matrix form. The specification"
" of *ncol* and *format* is optional. Assume that ``E`` is a vector:"
msgstr ""
"其中 *expression* 可以是表达式或变量，\\ *ncol* 是每行打印的数值个数（默认为6），\\ *format* 是格式（默认为 "
"6F15.8）。这可用于以矩阵形式打印向量。\\ *ncol* 和 *format* 的指定是可选的。假设 ``E`` 是一个向量："

msgid "``SHOW,E`` prints ``E`` using defaults."
msgstr "``SHOW,E`` 使用默认设置打印 ``E``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SHOW[n],E`` prints ``E`` with ``n`` elements per line; (if ``n>6``, more "
"than one line is needed, but in any case a new line is started after ``n`` "
"elements)."
msgstr ""
"``SHOW[n],E`` 每行打印 ``E`` 的 ``n`` 个元素；（如果 ``n>6``\\ ，则需要多行，但无论如何在 ``n`` "
"个元素后都会开始新的一行）。"

msgid ""
"``SHOW[n,10f10.4],E`` prints ``E`` in the format given, with newline forced "
"after ``n`` elements."
msgstr "``SHOW[n,10f10.4],E`` 以给定格式打印 ``E``\\ ，并在 ``n`` 个元素后强制换行。"

msgid ""
"Note that the total length of the format should not exceed 100 characters (a"
" left margin of 30 characters is always needed)."
msgstr "请注意，格式的总长度不应超过 100 个字符（始终需要 30 个字符的左边距）。"

msgid ""
"A *wild card* format can be used to show several variables more easily:"
msgstr "*通配符* 格式可用于更轻松地显示多个变量："

msgid "``SHOW,qm*,dm*``"
msgstr "``SHOW,qm*,dm*``"

msgid ""
"shows all variables whose names begin with ``QM`` and ``DM``. Note that no "
"letters must appear after the ``*``, i.e., the wild card format is less "
"general than in ``UNIX`` commands."
msgstr ""
"显示所有名称以 ``QM`` 和 ``DM`` 开头的变量。请注意，\\ ``*`` 后面不能出现任何字母，即通配符格式不如 ``UNIX`` "
"命令中的通用。"

msgid "See the ``TABLE`` command for another possibility to tabulate results."
msgstr "有关以表格形式呈现结果的另一种可能性，请参阅 ``TABLE`` 命令。"

msgid "Clearing variables"
msgstr "清除变量"

msgid "Variables can be deleted using"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令删除变量"

msgid "Wild cards can be used as in ``SHOW``, e.g.,"
msgstr "通配符可以像在 ``SHOW`` 命令中一样使用，例如，"

msgid "``CLEAR,ENERG*``"
msgstr "``CLEAR,ENERG*``"

msgid ""
"clears all variables whose names begin with ``ENERG``. All variables can be "
"cleared using"
msgstr "清除所有名称以 ``ENERG`` 开头的变量。可以使用以下命令清除所有变量"

msgid "``CLEARALL``"
msgstr "``CLEARALL``"

msgid ""
"The length of vectors can be truncated simply by redefining the length "
"specifier: ``#R=2`` truncates the array ``R`` to length 2. Higher elements "
"are no longer available (but could be redefined). Setting ``#R=0`` is "
"equivalent to the command ``CLEAR,R``."
msgstr ""
"向量的长度可以通过重新定义长度说明符来截断：\\ ``#R=2`` 将数组 ``R`` 截断为长度 2。更高的元素将不再可用（但可以重新定义）。设置 "
"``#R=0`` 等同于命令 ``CLEAR,R``\\ 。"

msgid "Reading variables from an external file"
msgstr "从外部文件读取变量"

msgid "Variables can be read from an external file using"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令从外部文件读取变量"

msgid ""
"Such files can be saved, for instance by the geometry optimization program, "
"and reused later to recover a certain optimized geometry. The format of the "
"input in *filename* is the same as for ordinary input."
msgstr ""
"此类文件可以被保存，例如由几何优化程序保存，并在以后重新使用以恢复某个优化后的几何结构。\\ *filename* 中的输入格式与普通输入相同。"

msgid ""
"If *option*\\ =\\ ``NOINDEX|IGNOREINDEX`` is given then variable indices are"
" ignored and only the last value saved is read (without index). This can be "
"useful if for example a file saved with ``SAVEACT`` in a geometry "
"optimization is read, and it is intended to continue with the variables that"
" were saved last."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 *option*\\ =\\ ``NOINDEX|IGNOREINDEX``\\ "
"，则忽略变量索引，仅读取最后保存的值（无索引）。例如，当读取在几何优化中使用 ``SAVEACT`` "
"保存的文件，并且打算继续使用最后保存的变量时，这可能很有用。"
